(36821, 'koKR', '고리안 훈련장 공격', '어둠달 오크와 공허의 하수인들을 최대한 많이 처치해야 합니다.', '[PH]Commander! You just missed a group of rangari with some disturbing news. The Shadowmoon Orcs have been spotted in the hills above Anguish Fortress. The scouts reported seeing strange rituals and beings of pure darkness. Those orcs must be up there trying to summon more minions from the Void!$B$BIf we do not intervene all we have gained in Shadowmoon Valley might be lost!', '', '', '', '', '', '', 25549),
(36820, 'koKR', '고리안 훈련장 공격', '어둠달 오크와 공허의 하수인들을 최대한 많이 처치해야 합니다.', '[PH]Commander! You just missed a group of rangari with some disturbing news. The Shadowmoon Orcs have been spotted in the hills above Anguish Fortress. The scouts reported seeing strange rituals and beings of pure darkness. Those orcs must be up there trying to summon more minions from the Void!$B$BIf we do not intervene all we have gained in Shadowmoon Valley might be lost!', '', '', '', '', '', '', 25549),
